    "id": "data.replay",
    "label": "Replay Event Stream…",
    "help": "Online conformance (sim_conformance_stream): replay an ordered event stream — a log artifact in row order, or inline `events` [{case, activity, timestamp?}] — case by case from the initial marking, force-firing divergent events so cases resynchronise. Reports the first divergence (blocking places, marking, the shortest repair of unobserved transitions) and stores a running-fitness time series (x = event index) and the replay of one case as a trace (step 0 = initial marking; sim.goto replays it): `case`, else the first divergent case, else the first case.",
